@startuml
title Activity Diagram - GitHub Issue Workflow

start

:User creates issue;
:Add title and description;
:Assign labels;

if (Issue is clear?) then (yes)
    :Assign developer;
else (no)
    :Ask for clarification;
    :Update issue description;
endif

:Developer investigates problem;

if (Code change required?) then (yes)
    :Create branch;
    :Implement fix;
    :Open pull request;
    :Review pull request;
    :Merge pull request;
else (no)
    :Add explanation or documentation;
endif

:Close issue;

stop

@enduml
